bbell up and maintain the neutral spin position, hold for 3-5 seconds at every rep."}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Single Arm Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8},{"r":8,"rpe":9,"x":2}],"note":"Go heavy as you can while maintaining the correct form. As you move the weight down, go slow and controlled."},{"n":"Hammer Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pinwheel Curl","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}],"note":"Slow as you move up all the way and go across the body. Slow and controlled as you bring the weight down all the way."},{"n":"Standing Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":7.5},{"r":8,"rpe":8.5},{"r":10,"rpe":7.5},{"r":6,"rpe":9.5}],"note":"The pace is fast but the form should be maintained at all times. First and third set, use lighter weights. Bump up the weight in the 2nd set to make it harder but still doable. Last set, go heavy."},{"n":"Tricep Kickback","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Renegade Row","sets":[{"r":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Goblet Squat","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Split Squat (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Lunge (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Sumo Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Suitcase Carry","sets":[{"sec":600,"x":4}]},{"n":"B-Stance Romanian Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]}]}],[{"ex":[{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bent Over Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Arnold Press","sets":[{"r":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Front Squat (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Sumo Squat","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}],"note":"Pause at the bottom."},{"n":"Split Squat (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Reverse Lunge (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x"